  "content": "<h2>FTB 簡易水晶，</h2><p>簡化您的水晶採集流程。</p><p>FTB 簡易水晶讓您只需右鍵點擊即可採集完全成熟的萌芽水晶，無需破壞方塊。採集後，水晶會重置為其第一生長階段。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ez-crystals/example.gif\" alt=\"運作方式範例\"></p><h3>主要功能</h3><ul>\n<li>右鍵點擊採集完全成熟的萌芽水晶。</li>\n<li>空手採集可獲得 2 個碎片。</li>\n<li>使用鎬採集可獲得 4 個或更多碎片，數量隨幸運附魔提升。</li>\n<li>兼容原版紫水晶、應用能源 2 水晶、geOre 水晶等。</li>\n<li>支援資料包以新增其他萌芽水晶變種。</li>\n<li>整合 FTB Ultimine 可進行水晶批量採集。</li>\n</ul><p>無論您是自動化資源收集，還是厭倦手動破壞每個晶簇，FTB 簡易水晶都能讓過程快速、直觀且高效。</p><h2>支援</h2><ul>\n<li>若遇<strong>模組包</strong>問題，請前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>若遇<strong>模組</strong>問題，請前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>僅有疑問？請查看我們的 Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul><h2>授權</h2><p>所有權利歸 Feed The Beast Ltd. 所有。原始碼為<code>可見原始碼</code>，詳情請參閱我們的 <a href=\"https://github.com/FTBTeam/FTB-EZCrystals/blob/main/LICENSE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE.md</a>。對此模組提交的任何 Pull Request 必須在請求被考慮前簽署並同意 CLA（貢獻者授權協議）。</p><hr><h2>保持更新</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
